  <title id="ctstratswot-title">SWOT grid for a hypothetical warehouse-robot startup</title>
  <desc id="ctstratswot-desc">A two-by-two grid. Columns separate factors helpful and harmful to the goal; rows separate internal factors, which the team controls, from external factors in the market. Strengths include an in-house navigation stack and two pilot sites; weaknesses include no certified safety case and a single person who knows the firmware; opportunities include an integrator seeking a partner and cheaper lidar; threats include a large vendor entering and customer bans on cloud links.</desc>
  <defs>
    <marker id="ctstratswot-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path class="arrowhead" d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" />
    </marker>
  </defs>
  <text class="small" x="220.0" y="30.0" text-anchor="middle">Helpful to the goal</text>
  <text class="small" x="500.0" y="30.0" text-anchor="middle">Harmful to the goal</text>
  <text class="small" x="14.0" y="106.0" text-anchor="start">Internal</text>
  <text class="small" x="14.0" y="122.0" text-anchor="start">(the team)</text>
  <text class="small" x="14.0" y="246.0" text-anchor="start">External</text>
  <text class="small" x="14.0" y="262.0" text-anchor="start">(the market)</text>
  <rect class="box" x="84" y="44" width="272" height="132" rx="3" />
  <text x="96.0" y="68.0" text-anchor="start">Strengths</text>
  <text class="small" x="96.0" y="94.0" text-anchor="start">• Navigation stack written in-house</text>
  <text class="small" x="96.0" y="115.0" text-anchor="start">• Two pilot sites already running</text>
  <text class="small" x="96.0" y="136.0" text-anchor="start">• Low hardware cost per robot</text>
  <text class="small" x="96.0" y="157.0" text-anchor="start">• Fast release cycle</text>
  <rect class="box" x="364" y="44" width="272" height="132" rx="3" />
  <text x="376.0" y="68.0" text-anchor="start">Weaknesses</text>
  <text class="small" x="376.0" y="94.0" text-anchor="start">• No certified safety case yet</text>
  <text class="small" x="376.0" y="115.0" text-anchor="start">• One person knows the firmware</text>
  <text class="small" x="376.0" y="136.0" text-anchor="start">• No dedicated sales staff</text>
  <text class="small" x="376.0" y="157.0" text-anchor="start">• Thin test coverage on hardware</text>
  <rect class="box" x="84" y="184" width="272" height="132" rx="3" />
  <text x="96.0" y="208.0" text-anchor="start">Opportunities</text>
  <text class="small" x="96.0" y="234.0" text-anchor="start">• Integrator looking for a robot partner</text>
  <text class="small" x="96.0" y="255.0" text-anchor="start">• Cheaper lidar modules appearing</text>
  <text class="small" x="96.0" y="276.0" text-anchor="start">• Night shifts hard to staff</text>
  <text class="small" x="96.0" y="297.0" text-anchor="start">• Customers asking for open APIs</text>
  <rect class="box" x="364" y="184" width="272" height="132" rx="3" />
  <text x="376.0" y="208.0" text-anchor="start">Threats</text>
  <text class="small" x="376.0" y="234.0" text-anchor="start">• Large vendor entering the segment</text>
  <text class="small" x="376.0" y="255.0" text-anchor="start">• Customer IT forbids cloud links</text>
  <text class="small" x="376.0" y="276.0" text-anchor="start">• Long lead times on motor drivers</text>
  <text class="small" x="376.0" y="297.0" text-anchor="start">• Liability if a robot hurts someone</text>

